{"name": "Sweep", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SWEEP is a tactical card game. 1 card = 1 bullet\u2014play all 17 cards to unleash explosive damage by skillfully combining card hands, stickers, and items.<br/><br/><strong>PS. The game doesn\u2019t follow the standard poker hand rules.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick the cards you want straight from the deck and use your wisdom to create the best combinations.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"337\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/extras/6ac91dc40020b17a4f7cb3d44c2dc46d.poster.avif?t=1755396112\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/extras/6ac91dc40020b17a4f7cb3d44c2dc46d.webm?t=1755396112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Transform Cards into Bullets and Trigger Chain Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize stickers and items on the cards to trigger an astonishing chain of effects, transforming cards into bullets to unleash devastating damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"337\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/extras/3105538dca1bdab6eecae83ca2482a2c.poster.avif?t=1755396112\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/extras/3105538dca1bdab6eecae83ca2482a2c.webm?t=1755396112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clear Your Hand, Seize Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you clear your hand, you gain a brand-new turn and double all damage dealt. Keep clearing cards to overpower your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"337\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/extras/6bc77450aeacdfc9fffc2a194ff85789.poster.avif?t=1755396112\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/extras/6bc77450aeacdfc9fffc2a194ff85789.webm?t=1755396112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you stack items for massive damage or masterfully play for extra turns, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "SWEEP is an adventure card game. Use your submachine gun and cards to escape the dungeon. 1 card = 1 bullet\u2014play all 17 cards. Trigger chain effects, unleash damage, and take control!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393180/header.jpg?t=1755396112", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike", "Strategy", "Card Battler", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelite", "Card Game"], "developers": "On.Production", "publishers": "On.Production", "release_date": "Apr 11, 2025", "price": "$4.89", "appid": "3393180", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 January 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/YXPrSbi9Iog", "first_seen": 1738022400.0, "review_rank": 1885}